    "body": "**Problem:** Wallet encryption ignores a failed database rewrite after encrypted key records have been committed.\nOld plaintext key material can remain in unused pages without a warning.\n\n**Fix:** Log the cleanup failure while preserving the successful encryption result.\nThe warning advises moving funds to a newly created wallet before relying on at-rest encryption.\n",
